{"parse":{"title":"天赋/历史学者","pageid":3226,"revid":7029,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>历史学者</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8E.86.E5.8F.B2.E5.AD.A6.E8.80.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"历史学者\"><b>历史学者</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"天赋 历史学者.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/57/nk1207mwrq6u4atps98gpkbng73yl2c.png/80px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B_%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/57/nk1207mwrq6u4atps98gpkbng73yl2c.png/120px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B_%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/57/nk1207mwrq6u4atps98gpkbng73yl2c.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />历史学者\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>自身回合开始时，在<font color=\"red\">4</font>格范围随机[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]发现1-2个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"书卷\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">书卷</font></span></span>]，拾取<font color=\"red\">5</font>个后，本次行动结束时可使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"blue\">史学技能</font></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A1%94%E5%9F%83%E5%B0%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/塔埃尔\"><img alt=\"头像 塔埃尔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d1/as6w1roh2osoc7ownjw54ztpyjctajb.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">塔埃尔</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>移动力提高<font color=\"red\">1</font>格。自身回合开始时，在<font color=\"red\">4</font>格范围随机[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]发现1-2个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"书卷\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">书卷</font></span></span>]，拾取<font color=\"red\">5</font>个后，本次行动结束时可使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"blue\">史学技能</font></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>移动力提高<font color=\"red\">1</font>格。自身回合开始时，在<font color=\"red\">4</font>格范围随机[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]发现1-2个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"书卷\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">书卷</font></span></span>]，拾取<font color=\"red\">5</font>个后，本次行动结束时可使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"blue\">史学技能</font></span>]。每次[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，移动力增加<font color=\"red\">2</font>格，最多<font color=\"red\">4</font>格，效果持续到行动结束。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋四星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>移动力提高<font color=\"red\">1</font>格，治疗效果提高<font color=\"green\">15%</font>。自身回合开始时，在<font color=\"red\">4</font>格范围随机[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]发现1-2个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"书卷\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">书卷</font></span></span>]，拾取<font color=\"red\">5</font>个后，本次行动结束时可使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"blue\">史学技能</font></span>]。每次[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，移动力增加<font color=\"red\">2</font>格，最多<font color=\"red\">4</font>格，效果持续到行动结束。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋五星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bf/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bf/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bf/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>移动力提高<font color=\"red\">1</font>格，治疗效果提高<font color=\"green\">15%</font>。自身回合开始时，在<font color=\"red\">4</font>格范围随机[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]发现1-2个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"书卷\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">书卷</font></span></span>]，拾取<font color=\"red\">4</font>个后，本次行动结束时可使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"blue\">史学技能</font></span>]。每次[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]时，移动力增加<font color=\"red\">2</font>格，最多<font color=\"red\">4</font>格，效果持续到行动结束。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163736\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.232 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.350 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6042/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 46282/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12519/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  320.211      1 模板:天赋\n100.00%  320.211      1 -total\n 32.80%  105.014      5 模板:中括号介绍化\n 29.99%   96.038     18 模